config SPRDWL_NG
	tristate "Spreadtrum sprdwl_ng WLAN driver (sc2355, SDIO)"
	depends on CFG80211
	default y
	---help---
	Reconstructed Unisoc sc2355 WLAN driver for the Motorola Moto G20
	(java / sharkl5pro). Hardware-validated 2026-09-26: association,
	DHCP, traffic, scans equivalent to the stock module. Built as a
	module (m) so the Android WiFi HAL keeps its finit_module /
	delete_module lifecycle; do not build in (=y) without reworking the
	HAL power sequencing.
